{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super High Ball is a unique blend between a <strong>Pinball</strong> and a <strong>Precision Platformer</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just call it a <u><strong>Punishing Puzzle Pinball Precision Physics Platformer</strong></u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/719930/extras/e50841e332aa9a64e897f1a95e4e322b.poster.avif?t=1773047198\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/719930/extras/e50841e332aa9a64e897f1a95e4e322b.webm?t=1773047198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/719930/extras/e50841e332aa9a64e897f1a95e4e322b.mp4?t=1773047198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <strong>flippers</strong> scattered across the level to overcome gaps, fire, timed lasers, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate the cannons to launch the ball, <strong>defy gravity</strong>, and use the <strong>power to slow the ball</strong>, precisely choosing the fastest path to the finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/719930/extras/79b15d99fb75dd65baeda959bdc0c201.poster.avif?t=1773047198\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/719930/extras/79b15d99fb75dd65baeda959bdc0c201.webm?t=1773047198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/719930/extras/79b15d99fb75dd65baeda959bdc0c201.mp4?t=1773047198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super High Ball is difficult due to its unique gameplay, but it is fun and addictive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lasers, fire, holes, aiming cannons, wind, and traps stand between you and the end. One single mistake, and you <strong>instantly respawn</strong> at the latest checkpoint!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/719930/extras/5af9f44ed1d8f0083cfd538461a9c79f.poster.avif?t=1773047198\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/719930/extras/5af9f44ed1d8f0083cfd538461a9c79f.webm?t=1773047198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/719930/extras/5af9f44ed1d8f0083cfd538461a9c79f.mp4?t=1773047198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re looking for more <strong>challenges</strong> and <strong>customization</strong>, try completing the goals on each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death limits, time limits, and artifact collection are here to test your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete against the rest of the world in the leaderboard! Only time counts! You have to go fast!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/719930/extras/9400e346c55b841252699868f2e4b183.poster.avif?t=1773047198\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/719930/extras/9400e346c55b841252699868f2e4b183.webm?t=1773047198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/719930/extras/9400e346c55b841252699868f2e4b183.mp4?t=1773047198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"8edc675145e795867a79f1439c8d430c2f822d41.jpg","localized_name":"Ready to climb","name":"Ready to climb","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/719930/8edc675145e795867a79f1439c8d430c2f822d41.jpg"},{"icon":"7f6836677b3713cefa24e228d1713c074fc2f059.jpg","localized_name":"Out of the Plain","name":"Out of the Plain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/719930/7f6836677b3713cefa24e228d1713c074fc2f059.jpg"},{"icon":"f794e8ca28cb1a07b7fad82db30e9c262121ac50.jpg","localized_name":"Out of the Caves","name":"Out of the Caves","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/719930/f794e8ca28cb1a07b7fad82db30e9c262121ac50.jpg"},{"icon":"aef27916582ad37eb52c56fe7fbe2770d84d2db2.jpg","localized_name":"Out of the Cliff","name":"Out of the Cliff","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/719930/aef27916582ad37eb52c56fe7fbe2770d84d2db2.jpg"},{"icon":"0e56609d4531798cbdf96665028bf2c6d24d00d5.jpg","localized_name":"Out of the Volcano","name":"Out of the Volcano","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/719930/0e56609d4531798cbdf96665028bf2c6d24d00d5.jpg"},{"icon":"998cc7330fb98f593ca0083bdb75c182acd3f23a.jpg","localized_name":"Out of the Peak","name":"Out of the Peak","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/719930/998cc7330fb98f593ca0083bdb75c182acd3f23a.jpg"},{"icon":"870182782a81bc460dc5ee1d2b5b470ae1009a5b.jpg","localized_name":"Gold!","name":"Gold!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/719930/870182782a81bc460dc5ee1d2b5b470ae1009a5b.jpg"},{"icon":"4ff251c421f1520b45598a302d0bf101edd4a083.jpg","loc